	(text "POWER: 2 x AAA (2.0-3.2 V) on J1 -> SW2 slide switch (off = cells disconnected) -> Q1 AO3401A\nreverse-battery guard (gate to GND) -> VBAT -> U1 TPS61023 boost, always on (EN tied to VIN).\n3V3 = 0.595 V x (1 + R1/R2) = 0.595 x (1 + 1M/220k) = 3.30 V. L1 1 uH.\nVBAT_SENSE = VBAT / 2 (R3/R4 1M, ~1.5 uA) -> IO3 (ADC1_CH3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1e78805d-b2f9-54aa-9de9-13bbd3583a4b")
	)
	(text "MCU: ESP32-C3-WROOM-02 on the board's BOTTOM face (frees the top for the eye LEDs), PCB antenna\non the back edge, copper-free underneath. IO0 PIR_OUT and IO1 BTN wake it from deep sleep.\nIO4/IO5/IO6 = I2S BCLK/LRCLK/DIN, IO7 AMP_SD, IO10 EYE_LED. Straps IO2/IO8/IO9 pulled high.\nNative USB (IO18/IO19) on the J2 Tag-Connect pads."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c4e36a40-8362-550a-89f4-806684f4c860")
	)
	(text "PIR: AM312 drops through a 10.8 mm board cutout onto a boss in the case; its legs reach J4 by wires.\nRC-filtered supply (R10/C8): PIRs false-trigger on boost / class-D / Wi-Fi ripple."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "617d6c52-f35d-5055-8f54-e8a84141a781")
	)
	(text "EYES: D1/D2 white 0603 under the light pipes in the eye highlights, R14/R15 47R from 3V3, Q2 low side\non IO10 (R16 holds it off at boot). Flash them with the alarm (LEDC PWM for a soft pulse)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "16074d5e-8b55-5304-aca6-a1531c2dc9df")
	)
	(text "BUTTON GLOW: LED1 WS2812B-2020 under the clear button on VLED, switched by Q3 from IO21 (low = on;\nR17 keeps it off), data on IO20 through R18. Run at 3.3 V (below its 3.7 V spec, as on ESP32-C3 dev\nboards): dim blue, which suits a soft glow. Colour or rainbow wheel picked on the AP-mode settings page."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 264.16 259.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8841bf5f-cb2a-57b5-898d-24534c23f3db")
	)
	(text "SOUND: MAX98357A (mono, left channel when SD_MODE is driven high; R11 keeps it off otherwise).\nGAIN_SLOT open = 9 dB. Drives the 20 mm 8 ohm speaker on J3 directly (Rev A's piezo resistors gone)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "22b6aa5e-bf41-54b2-b890-a1e8473bf617")
	)
